                            </p>
                            <small class="text-muted fw-bold d-block">— BS.CKII Nguyễn Minh Tuấn (Trưởng kíp cấp cứu 24/7 RescuePets)</small>
                        </blockquote>

                        <h3 class="serif-title text-dark mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold" style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #071D2A;">
